* **Render v20 / v21 as soon as pyglet-cocoa recovers** — still
  blocking visual verification of the entire iter-10/11 stack.
* **Bundle a custom game font**. Consensus typography complaint
  surviving three iterations now.
* **``InputEvent`` modifier fields** (shift / ctrl / alt / meta)
  so event-aware handlers can actually *use* modifier state.
  The event plumbing is already in place.
* **``ReactiveValue.default`` ergonomic simplification** — seed
  snapshot from one-shot callable invocation at construction.
* **``layout_budget`` radial-sizing utility**.
* **Clean up ``_SIG_TAKES_EVENT`` cache** — weak-reference or
  per-scene lifetime rather than module-global id-keyed.

