* **Render** when pyglet recovers — eight-iteration backlog.
* **Bundle a custom game font** — nine iterations old. At this
  point the consensus-driven typography complaint has quietly
  survived more rounds than any other parked item.
* **``primary`` synthetic modifier**? Cross-platform Cmd-or-Ctrl
  convenience, if a saga2d game needs it.
* **Docs / README pass**. Seventeen iterations of framework
